(4534661, 653450, 68035, '<td valign="top">One of my three favourite pictures in the challenge.  A very different and appealing interpretation of ''Black Dog'' (even though I suspect the dog may not really be black in real life, but who cares it is in this image).  Very nice composition with a lovely diagonal leading line.  Excellent and  atmospheric B&amp;W conversion which suits the subject well - 9</td>', 'One of my three favourite pictures in the challenge.  A very different and appealing interpretation of ''Black Dog'' (even though I suspect the dog may not really be black in real life, but who cares it is in this image).  Very nice composition with a lovely diagonal leading line.  Excellent and  atmospheric B&W conversion which suits the subject well - 9', '2008-03-03 08:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4534663, 653829, 68035, '<td valign="top">One of my three favourites of the challenge.  Beautiful capture of the sea which is half way ''silky water'' and half way cloud like but totally awesome<br/> <br/>The way the clouds almost rfelect the choppiness of the water is outstanding and the rocks are big enough to provide a wonderful feature yet not too overpowering as to diminish the ocean itself <br/> <br/>Outstanding 9</td>', 'One of my three favourites of the challenge.  Beautiful capture of the sea which is half way ''silky water'' and half way cloud like but totally awesome The way the clouds almost rfelect the choppiness of the water is outstanding and the rocks are big enough to provide a wonderful feature yet not too overpowering as to diminish the ocean itself  Outstanding 9', '2008-03-03 08:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
