(4536499, 653494, 82985, '<td valign="top">simple, nice form and composition, and I liked that this remained toward the high key side, rather than dark and contrasty as some might have done.  The pastel background and general feeling of light really convey the sunny seaside context nicely.  Very well done.  9</td>', 'simple, nice form and composition, and I liked that this remained toward the high key side, rather than dark and contrasty as some might have done.  The pastel background and general feeling of light really convey the sunny seaside context nicely.  Very well done.  9', '2008-03-03 21:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
