(4541829, 653602, 65234, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is the back side of the markers at a military cemetery, where we only occasionally see the "wife of" on the back.  That''s always bothered me.  At least this place allowed a personal note in addition to name and date, so there''s something acknowledging the wife was a person.<br/> <br/>Oh, sorry, getting close to a rant.  Back to the shot: good tones and you obviously hit an emotional point with me!</td>', 'I''m guessing this is the back side of the markers at a military cemetery, where we only occasionally see the "wife of" on the back.  That''s always bothered me.  At least this place allowed a personal note in addition to name and date, so there''s something acknowledging the wife was a person. Oh, sorry, getting close to a rant.  Back to the shot: good tones and you obviously hit an emotional point with me!', '2008-03-05 20:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4541834, 653790, 65234, '<td valign="top">I love old cemeteries.  Especially poignant in the cold snow.</td>', 'I love old cemeteries.  Especially poignant in the cold snow.', '2008-03-05 20:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
