(4541991, 651074, 89940, '<td valign="top">Great color and very sharp. Like the DOF except for the blurring just to the left of the bird''s tail.</td>', 'Great color and very sharp. Like the DOF except for the blurring just to the left of the bird''s tail.', '2008-03-05 21:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4541997, 653602, 89940, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a lot but there is something about that bothers me. I''ve been looking at if for a couple of minutes and the only thing I can figure out is that the tombstones look kinda of like they were pasted onto the bcakground in a few spots. There is no real depth on some of the ones on the far right. Not sure what would cause this or how it could be fixed.</td>', 'I like this photo a lot but there is something about that bothers me. I''ve been looking at if for a couple of minutes and the only thing I can figure out is that the tombstones look kinda of like they were pasted onto the bcakground in a few spots. There is no real depth on some of the ones on the far right. Not sure what would cause this or how it could be fixed.', '2008-03-05 21:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542000, 653718, 89940, '<td valign="top">The red seems a little too bright and jumps out at me more than the other 2 (which is normal for a bright red I guess but it seems a little too much to me).</td>', 'The red seems a little too bright and jumps out at me more than the other 2 (which is normal for a bright red I guess but it seems a little too much to me).', '2008-03-05 21:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542006, 653799, 89940, '<td valign="top">This is the best of the stairway bunch. Love the color, really grabs my attention. The upside down look certainly makes what would be an otherwise uninteresting photo very interesting. But every time I look at it my mind realizes it is upside down and tries to flip it and it takes me a minute to really appreciate it.</td>', 'This is the best of the stairway bunch. Love the color, really grabs my attention. The upside down look certainly makes what would be an otherwise uninteresting photo very interesting. But every time I look at it my mind realizes it is upside down and tries to flip it and it takes me a minute to really appreciate it.', '2008-03-05 21:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542008, 653475, 89940, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Overall I like the lighting but would like to see a little bit more on the left (right side of the dog).</td>', 'Great shot. Overall I like the lighting but would like to see a little bit more on the left (right side of the dog).', '2008-03-05 21:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542011, 653659, 89940, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and nice color. Would like it a little better if the heart shaped portion was a little brighter.</td>', 'Very sharp and nice color. Would like it a little better if the heart shaped portion was a little brighter.', '2008-03-05 21:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542014, 653804, 89940, '<td valign="top">I love the concept and the coloring. The key is a little hard to make out. Also would like to see it not cropped quite so tight. Everytime I see this photo I want to see more to the right of the photo (the left is fine).</td>', 'I love the concept and the coloring. The key is a little hard to make out. Also would like to see it not cropped quite so tight. Everytime I see this photo I want to see more to the right of the photo (the left is fine).', '2008-03-05 21:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542017, 653564, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice color, really like the DOF except would like if the bird''s eye was a little sharper.</td>', 'Nice color, really like the DOF except would like if the bird''s eye was a little sharper.', '2008-03-05 21:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542021, 653824, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Like the DOF. Find the highlight on the forehead a little distracting. It''s what draws my eye when I first look at the photo then my eye moves down to the eyes.</td>', 'Nice photo. Like the DOF. Find the highlight on the forehead a little distracting. It''s what draws my eye when I first look at the photo then my eye moves down to the eyes.', '2008-03-05 21:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542026, 653800, 89940, '<td valign="top">Like the concept and nice lighting. It took me a moment to realize what the green bars were supposed to be. Might be better if a little more of the cage was shown. Also don''t really like the hand hanging on to the bar. Since it''s the brightest thing in the photo that is what grabs my eye first.</td>', 'Like the concept and nice lighting. It took me a moment to realize what the green bars were supposed to be. Might be better if a little more of the cage was shown. Also don''t really like the hand hanging on to the bar. Since it''s the brightest thing in the photo that is what grabs my eye first.', '2008-03-05 21:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542035, 653621, 89940, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. The reflections of the clouds are great in the middle of the photo but were not obvious at the bottom of the photo. I kept think it was silt in the water or something. The stream does a great job of leading my eye back and off to...nothing? a telephone pole? I figured out it was the hills but only because of the title.</td>', 'Interesting shot. The reflections of the clouds are great in the middle of the photo but were not obvious at the bottom of the photo. I kept think it was silt in the water or something. The stream does a great job of leading my eye back and off to...nothing? a telephone pole? I figured out it was the hills but only because of the title.', '2008-03-05 21:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542036, 653603, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait from a technical standpoint, but I find it kind of uninteresting.</td>', 'Nice portrait from a technical standpoint, but I find it kind of uninteresting.', '2008-03-05 21:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542040, 653462, 89940, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. That''s a nasty looking gash. Would like to hear the story behind it. Kind of looks like a mug shot. Don''t like the way the hair at the top was cropped off.</td>', 'Interesting photo. That''s a nasty looking gash. Would like to hear the story behind it. Kind of looks like a mug shot. Don''t like the way the hair at the top was cropped off.', '2008-03-05 21:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542042, 653361, 89940, '<td valign="top">The DOF and lighting really work well to make this person seem like they are coming at you. The face is a little too bright for my taste but otherwise a nice photo</td>', 'The DOF and lighting really work well to make this person seem like they are coming at you. The face is a little too bright for my taste but otherwise a nice photo', '2008-03-05 21:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542045, 652968, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting on the hand, the color of the lemon looks very muted compared to the background. The background is so bright it makes it look like the hand was just pasted onto it.</td>', 'Nice lighting on the hand, the color of the lemon looks very muted compared to the background. The background is so bright it makes it look like the hand was just pasted onto it.', '2008-03-05 22:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542048, 653676, 89940, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Definitely makes me feel dazed and confused. Since there is no clear subject my eyes dart all over the place trying to make sense of it all. Everytime I look at this it takes me a little while to process and figure out what is going on. Not sure if that is a good thing or not.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Definitely makes me feel dazed and confused. Since there is no clear subject my eyes dart all over the place trying to make sense of it all. Everytime I look at this it takes me a little while to process and figure out what is going on. Not sure if that is a good thing or not.', '2008-03-05 22:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542049, 653450, 89940, '<td valign="top">Like the mist and water and how the background fades into the mist. The dog is just OK, there is a fuzzy hump that keeps drawing my attention and I spend more time looking at that hump than taking in the whole photo.</td>', 'Like the mist and water and how the background fades into the mist. The dog is just OK, there is a fuzzy hump that keeps drawing my attention and I spend more time looking at that hump than taking in the whole photo.', '2008-03-05 22:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542051, 653494, 89940, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo and every time I come back to it I like it better. Nice color, great DOF. I''m not sure what I would change in it (which is rare :) )</td>', 'I really like this photo and every time I come back to it I like it better. Nice color, great DOF. I''m not sure what I would change in it (which is rare :) )', '2008-03-05 22:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542057, 653839, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice color. I go back an forth on the lighting but have decided I like it. The composition is OK but doesn''t really do anything for me.</td>', 'Nice color. I go back an forth on the lighting but have decided I like it. The composition is OK but doesn''t really do anything for me.', '2008-03-05 22:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542060, 653510, 89940, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle this was shot from. Would like it not to be quite so dark on the guys left side, would like to see a little more of his shoulder and face.</td>', 'I really like the angle this was shot from. Would like it not to be quite so dark on the guys left side, would like to see a little more of his shoulder and face.', '2008-03-05 22:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542061, 653541, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting on the face and hand. Like the DOF. Would like to see a little more of the outside and less of the inside.</td>', 'Nice lighting on the face and hand. Like the DOF. Would like to see a little more of the outside and less of the inside.', '2008-03-05 22:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542072, 653462, 56744, '<td valign="top">What a superb portrait. I wish I could give you more than 10</td>', 'What a superb portrait. I wish I could give you more than 10', '2008-03-05 22:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542180, 653699, 9763, '<td valign="top">The color is a bit offputting.  The focus is also off.  I think lighting the background (fade to white) may have helped, but focus and lighting is key.</td>', 'The color is a bit offputting.  The focus is also off.  I think lighting the background (fade to white) may have helped, but focus and lighting is key.', '2008-03-05 23:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
