(4542193, 651160, 9763, '<td valign="top">The keys are clear, but the lemon is out of focus.  Reshoot and tone down the magenta.</td>', 'The keys are clear, but the lemon is out of focus.  Reshoot and tone down the magenta.', '2008-03-05 23:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542195, 652633, 9763, '<td valign="top">The ghosting blur is a bit distracting.  I think the color is nice though.</td>', 'The ghosting blur is a bit distracting.  I think the color is nice though.', '2008-03-05 23:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542199, 653677, 9763, '<td valign="top">A little less motion and some better lighting maybe?  I think the color is slightly too orange too.</td>', 'A little less motion and some better lighting maybe?  I think the color is slightly too orange too.', '2008-03-05 23:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542203, 653769, 9763, '<td valign="top">Very candid feeling, not overly focused on the dogs.  My eyes are drawn to the colorful buildings.  I am not pulled into this photo.  Try to focus on the dogs, or one dog... zoom in.</td>', 'Very candid feeling, not overly focused on the dogs.  My eyes are drawn to the colorful buildings.  I am not pulled into this photo.  Try to focus on the dogs, or one dog... zoom in.', '2008-03-05 23:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542205, 653009, 9763, '<td valign="top">The color seems off, too much flash?  The idea is fun, but i think the composition could be more intriguing.</td>', 'The color seems off, too much flash?  The idea is fun, but i think the composition could be more intriguing.', '2008-03-05 23:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542207, 652386, 9763, '<td valign="top">Nice bird, but not a brilliant photo as the colors are slightly yellowish.  I also think the focus could be sharper.</td>', 'Nice bird, but not a brilliant photo as the colors are slightly yellowish.  I also think the focus could be sharper.', '2008-03-05 23:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542210, 653493, 9763, '<td valign="top">Cute, but dark.  Add more light and focus.</td>', 'Cute, but dark.  Add more light and focus.', '2008-03-05 23:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542212, 653583, 9763, '<td valign="top">A bit yellow in tone, and not an exciting subject.  The horizontal lines are slightly off of the horizon too.   Maybe try black and white with more of the background out of focus.</td>', 'A bit yellow in tone, and not an exciting subject.  The horizontal lines are slightly off of the horizon too.   Maybe try black and white with more of the background out of focus.', '2008-03-05 23:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542213, 653796, 9763, '<td valign="top">The composition is a bit tight.  I think zoom in or out, but this is not a captivating composition.  Also, it seems slightly blrry.</td>', 'The composition is a bit tight.  I think zoom in or out, but this is not a captivating composition.  Also, it seems slightly blrry.', '2008-03-05 23:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542216, 653716, 9763, '<td valign="top">A bit high in contrast and slightly red.  I''d throw more pennies into the mix.</td>', 'A bit high in contrast and slightly red.  I''d throw more pennies into the mix.', '2008-03-05 23:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542325, 653802, 12611, '<td valign="top">is that supposed to be a feather? brilliant.<br/>I think the composition is a bit crowded but the details are nice.</td>', 'is that supposed to be a feather? brilliant.I think the composition is a bit crowded but the details are nice.', '2008-03-06 00:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542328, 653669, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting. So warm and nice on the cabanas, great shot.</td>', 'Excellent lighting. So warm and nice on the cabanas, great shot.', '2008-03-06 00:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542330, 653404, 56754, '<td valign="top">Excellent choices in post-processing.  Normally I am not a fan of visible halos when people dodge and burn, but it enormously helps create the effect relevant to the title you chose.  <br/> <br/>The feel is very ethereal, but I think I would like to see a bit more detail in her left arm and the bow (as it was not easily apparent to identify).  Overall it''s a good capture, and a great interpretation of the song lyric chosen!</td>', 'Excellent choices in post-processing.  Normally I am not a fan of visible halos when people dodge and burn, but it enormously helps create the effect relevant to the title you chose.   The feel is very ethereal, but I think I would like to see a bit more detail in her left arm and the bow (as it was not easily apparent to identify).  Overall it''s a good capture, and a great interpretation of the song lyric chosen!', '2008-03-06 00:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542335, 653084, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love the blue and green tones in here; there is a touh too much blur that makes your eyes stare at teh a the mounds.</td>', 'I love the blue and green tones in here; there is a touh too much blur that makes your eyes stare at teh a the mounds.', '2008-03-06 00:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542412, 653651, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I think this would work better not zoomed in quite so close so that it''s more obvious that it is a lemon. The focus is also a little soft.</td>', 'Nice idea. I think this would work better not zoomed in quite so close so that it''s more obvious that it is a lemon. The focus is also a little soft.', '2008-03-06 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542416, 653787, 89940, '<td valign="top">I realize that the light streaks are what you are going for but they don''t really work for me. The bright spot in the tree branches especially bothers me.</td>', 'I realize that the light streaks are what you are going for but they don''t really work for me. The bright spot in the tree branches especially bothers me.', '2008-03-06 01:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542418, 653822, 89940, '<td valign="top">Cute kitty. The DOF would normally be a little too narrow for my taste but it works in the context of Dazed and Confused. Would like it better if the ears weren''t chopped off.</td>', 'Cute kitty. The DOF would normally be a little too narrow for my taste but it works in the context of Dazed and Confused. Would like it better if the ears weren''t chopped off.', '2008-03-06 02:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542420, 653009, 89940, '<td valign="top">I like the concept but the implentation doesn''t do much for me. I don''t get the mask.  The lighting on the suit is a little harsh and the left hand is very washed out.</td>', 'I like the concept but the implentation doesn''t do much for me. I don''t get the mask.  The lighting on the suit is a little harsh and the left hand is very washed out.', '2008-03-06 02:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542422, 653404, 89940, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. The glow effect is a little overdone for my taste. The halo looks more like the surroundings were darkened instead of the halo brightened. Her face is also too soft, it looks out of focus.</td>', 'Interesting idea. The glow effect is a little overdone for my taste. The halo looks more like the surroundings were darkened instead of the halo brightened. Her face is also too soft, it looks out of focus.', '2008-03-06 02:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542424, 653299, 89940, '<td valign="top">Very interesting rock formation/statue. Really like the composition. The lighting on isn''t all that great. It highlights the middle of it and draws the eye there but a lot of the interesting part is in shadow or too dark.</td>', 'Very interesting rock formation/statue. Really like the composition. The lighting on isn''t all that great. It highlights the middle of it and draws the eye there but a lot of the interesting part is in shadow or too dark.', '2008-03-06 02:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542426, 653748, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. The man and child are out of focus which really detracts from the effect.</td>', 'Nice concept. The man and child are out of focus which really detracts from the effect.', '2008-03-06 02:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542428, 653677, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The middle couple is the obvious subject but there is too much motion blurring them too much. It''s a very busy image.</td>', 'Nice idea. The middle couple is the obvious subject but there is too much motion blurring them too much. It''s a very busy image.', '2008-03-06 02:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542430, 653597, 89940, '<td valign="top">I like the combo of stairway with graffiti. But it''s a little busy. It''s hard to identify the subjuct. Is it the guy going up the stairs, the person in the white jacket, the boy. It should be the stairs but that is 3rd or 4th on the list when initially looking at the photo.</td>', 'I like the combo of stairway with graffiti. But it''s a little busy. It''s hard to identify the subjuct. Is it the guy going up the stairs, the person in the white jacket, the boy. It should be the stairs but that is 3rd or 4th on the list when initially looking at the photo.', '2008-03-06 02:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542431, 653454, 89940, '<td valign="top">Pretty model. The lighting on the face is a little too bright compared to the rest of the body. It doesn''t really convy Dazed and Confused to me.</td>', 'Pretty model. The lighting on the face is a little too bright compared to the rest of the body. It doesn''t really convy Dazed and Confused to me.', '2008-03-06 02:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542444, 653654, 89940, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. Nice color. The feather certainly conveys motion but is a little too blurry for my taste.</td>', 'I like the concept. Nice color. The feather certainly conveys motion but is a little too blurry for my taste.', '2008-03-06 02:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542446, 653351, 89940, '<td valign="top">The pie looks great. I like the DOF. There is something about the lighting doesn''t work for me. I''m sorry that I can''t articulate what it is. I''m thinking it might look better if the background was perhaps a little darker. Or if just a portion of the pie was lit.</td>', 'The pie looks great. I like the DOF. There is something about the lighting doesn''t work for me. I''m sorry that I can''t articulate what it is. I''m thinking it might look better if the background was perhaps a little darker. Or if just a portion of the pie was lit.', '2008-03-06 02:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542447, 653726, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The colors seem a little dark to me, the lemons don''t really pop. The one that kind of does is the one on the left that looks a little shiny.</td>', 'Nice idea. The colors seem a little dark to me, the lemons don''t really pop. The one that kind of does is the one on the left that looks a little shiny.', '2008-03-06 02:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542448, 653583, 89940, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting on this one except for the shawdow that is the lower line. I also like the color in the brick. Overall I like the photo but it is a little uninteresting.</td>', 'Love the lighting on this one except for the shawdow that is the lower line. I also like the color in the brick. Overall I like the photo but it is a little uninteresting.', '2008-03-06 02:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542450, 652594, 89940, '<td valign="top">I looked at this photo 3 times before I noticed the tombstones. The tree overpowers the entire photo. The shadow lead my eyes to the tree and there they stayed for the first 2 viewings. I like the silhouette look of the tree but not the shadow of the trucks on the ground.</td>', 'I looked at this photo 3 times before I noticed the tombstones. The tree overpowers the entire photo. The shadow lead my eyes to the tree and there they stayed for the first 2 viewings. I like the silhouette look of the tree but not the shadow of the trucks on the ground.', '2008-03-06 02:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542451, 653005, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I like the water drops but the whole thing looks out of focus.</td>', 'Nice idea. I like the water drops but the whole thing looks out of focus.', '2008-03-06 02:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542455, 652308, 89940, '<td valign="top">Cute goats. Whenever I look at this photo my eye goes to the foreground goat. Then to the other goat and then back to the 1st. It wasn''t until I read the title that I noticed the door in the silo, and it wasn''t until much later that I noticed the barn door.  The goats are the subject not the doors.</td>', 'Cute goats. Whenever I look at this photo my eye goes to the foreground goat. Then to the other goat and then back to the 1st. It wasn''t until I read the title that I noticed the door in the silo, and it wasn''t until much later that I noticed the barn door.  The goats are the subject not the doors.', '2008-03-06 02:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542460, 653177, 89940, '<td valign="top">I initially did not care for the shoes but it grew on me. It gives you a presence in the photo and shows that you really are "down by the seaside". I don''t like that they are dead center and originally thought it would be better to have the feet off to one side but after playing around a bit I think it would be better to crop the left side of the photo.</td>', 'I initially did not care for the shoes but it grew on me. It gives you a presence in the photo and shows that you really are "down by the seaside". I don''t like that they are dead center and originally thought it would be better to have the feet off to one side but after playing around a bit I think it would be better to crop the left side of the photo.', '2008-03-06 02:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542461, 653802, 89940, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. I did not initially like the light coming from the top of the stairs but it grew on me. I don''t like the shadow along the right edge, it''s a little to hard.</td>', 'I like the idea. I did not initially like the light coming from the top of the stairs but it grew on me. I don''t like the shadow along the right edge, it''s a little to hard.', '2008-03-06 02:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542463, 653815, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice dog. Really sharp focus on the dog''s face. I like the DOF and the colored background. I don''t particularly like the dogs rear end being in the background.</td>', 'Nice dog. Really sharp focus on the dog''s face. I like the DOF and the colored background. I don''t particularly like the dogs rear end being in the background.', '2008-03-06 02:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542472, 652882, 90875, '<td valign="top">fantastic. jealousy</td>', 'fantastic. jealousy', '2008-03-06 03:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542477, 653730, 90875, '<td valign="top">love the strong contrast between black and white</td>', 'love the strong contrast between black and white', '2008-03-06 03:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542562, 653683, 70875, '<td valign="top">I would prefer a less yellow cast but the pose is good.</td>', 'I would prefer a less yellow cast but the pose is good.', '2008-03-06 04:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542563, 653730, 70875, '<td valign="top">Awesome contrast. Very well controlled.</td>', 'Awesome contrast. Very well controlled.', '2008-03-06 04:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542568, 652741, 70875, '<td valign="top">Exceptional.</td>', 'Exceptional.', '2008-03-06 04:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542585, 652323, 70875, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of CAs in the corner that you could fix in software (preferably in raw conversion).</td>', 'There''s a lot of CAs in the corner that you could fix in software (preferably in raw conversion).', '2008-03-06 05:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542645, 653475, 90495, '<td valign="top">This is probably the best ''black dog'' shot in the group. <br/> <br/>Tip, when photographing dogs or any animal with hair, don''t use diffusers, leave your lights bare. His hairs will pop out at you making this pic even more beautiful. I gave it a 9 solely because of the lack of detail on his right side and the overall lack of highlights in his hair.</td>', 'This is probably the best ''black dog'' shot in the group.  Tip, when photographing dogs or any animal with hair, don''t use diffusers, leave your lights bare. His hairs will pop out at you making this pic even more beautiful. I gave it a 9 solely because of the lack of detail on his right side and the overall lack of highlights in his hair.', '2008-03-06 06:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542665, 653829, 56754, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice capture- good use of long exposure.  I would have liked to see a little bit more in post-processing to make it really pop; nothing too drastic, maybe playing with curves, or even just dodging the clouds up top.<br/> <br/>A more dramatic crop also might increase the impact, instead of using 1/2 water, 1/2 sky, using 2/3 sky or water.<br/> <br/>6 for me</td>', 'This is a really nice capture- good use of long exposure.  I would have liked to see a little bit more in post-processing to make it really pop; nothing too drastic, maybe playing with curves, or even just dodging the clouds up top. A more dramatic crop also might increase the impact, instead of using 1/2 water, 1/2 sky, using 2/3 sky or water. 6 for me', '2008-03-06 07:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542670, 653738, 56754, '<td valign="top">I like the attitude you''ve captured in this image- it''s not sassy, not reserved but it has a nice confidence to it.  I love how her eyes match her surroundings, giving her a real sense of belonging.  The only things I''m unsure about are the <b>bold</b> border, and the uneven vignetting.  It looks great at the bottom, giving a nice transition into the contrasting border, but without the vignetting at the top to match it, it makes it look like an accident.<br/> <br/>I think I''ll bump this to a 7.</td>', 'I like the attitude you''ve captured in this image- it''s not sassy, not reserved but it has a nice confidence to it.  I love how her eyes match her surroundings, giving her a real sense of belonging.  The only things I''m unsure about are the bold border, and the uneven vignetting.  It looks great at the bottom, giving a nice transition into the contrasting border, but without the vignetting at the top to match it, it makes it look like an accident. I think I''ll bump this to a 7.', '2008-03-06 07:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542672, 653701, 56754, '<td valign="top">Lovely symmetrical composition, and great colors.  I especially love the details in the roofing.  Only thing I can suggest is to use some dodging/burning to bring out the details in the clouds (and to disguise that blown highlight in the sky).  That contrast in the sky would look great with the rotting, mossy roof!</td>', 'Lovely symmetrical composition, and great colors.  I especially love the details in the roofing.  Only thing I can suggest is to use some dodging/burning to bring out the details in the clouds (and to disguise that blown highlight in the sky).  That contrast in the sky would look great with the rotting, mossy roof!', '2008-03-06 07:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4542676, 653587, 56754, '<td valign="top">The exposure here is near-perfect, just a little blown in the snow.  The clarity is also very nice.  I''m still deciding whether or not I like the square-ish composition, maybe cropping out more of the background to her right would have a better feel?  Also, I think the purple umbrella would stand out a bit more if the model''s clothes weren''t so colorful.  <br/> <br/>6 for a good idea/execution</td>', 'The exposure here is near-perfect, just a little blown in the snow.  The clarity is also very nice.  I''m still deciding whether or not I like the square-ish composition, maybe cropping out more of the background to her right would have a better feel?  Also, I think the purple umbrella would stand out a bit more if the model''s clothes weren''t so colorful.   6 for a good idea/execution', '2008-03-06 07:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543040, 653738, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice work. One of my favorite Zep tunes.</td>', 'Nice work. One of my favorite Zep tunes.', '2008-03-06 10:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543050, 652882, 33672, '<td valign="top">COuld be the album cover for Physical Graffitti. Excellent</td>', 'COuld be the album cover for Physical Graffitti. Excellent', '2008-03-06 10:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543168, 653582, 91103, '<td valign="top">Very nice totaly Led Zeppelin [could have a cover]</td>', 'Very nice totaly Led Zeppelin [could have a cover]', '2008-03-06 11:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543249, 653473, 84124, '<td valign="top">If this isn''t top 10 then I don''t know what''s wrong with the voters.  well done.</td>', 'If this isn''t top 10 then I don''t know what''s wrong with the voters.  well done.', '2008-03-06 12:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543250, 653499, 84124, '<td valign="top">fantastic lighting, gloom is definitely present.  Although a bit of desaturation of the color would have helped.</td>', 'fantastic lighting, gloom is definitely present.  Although a bit of desaturation of the color would have helped.', '2008-03-06 12:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543477, 653499, 9763, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous color, eerie sky.  I really like this image!  I''d maybe rotate CC just .25 degrees or so.</td>', 'Gorgeous color, eerie sky.  I really like this image!  I''d maybe rotate CC just .25 degrees or so.', '2008-03-06 14:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543539, 653677, 74559, '<td valign="top">Love the motion blur, very fun image and SO fits the song :-)</td>', 'Love the motion blur, very fun image and SO fits the song :-)', '2008-03-06 14:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543540, 653565, 74559, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, great range of b&amp;w and just love that mist... well done!</td>', 'Beautiful image, great range of b&w and just love that mist... well done!', '2008-03-06 14:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543579, 652783, 91069, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture i like the depth of field udes here.</td>', 'Very cool picture i like the depth of field udes here.', '2008-03-06 14:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543671, 652990, 34938, '<td valign="top">I like the classiness of this 7</td>', 'I like the classiness of this 7', '2008-03-06 15:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4543835, 652917, 45475, '<td valign="top">Feels like a cool drawing from the 60s. Dig the glow around the car.</td>', 'Feels like a cool drawing from the 60s. Dig the glow around the car.', '2008-03-06 17:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544049, 653621, 1031, '<td valign="top">The calmness of the scene are an interesting contrast to the typical sound of the band. It''s an interesting blend of cool and warm colors.</td>', 'The calmness of the scene are an interesting contrast to the typical sound of the band. It''s an interesting blend of cool and warm colors.', '2008-03-06 20:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544063, 653778, 65234, '<td valign="top">EEK, it''s a demon!!!  Bit of overlit hair on the cheek, there.  Kund of a cherubic-looking demon, now that I look some more.  A baby devil ;-)</td>', 'EEK, it''s a demon!!!  Bit of overlit hair on the cheek, there.  Kund of a cherubic-looking demon, now that I look some more.  A baby devil ;-)', '2008-03-06 20:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544065, 653699, 65234, '<td valign="top">Squeezed and spent.  Quite appropriate for the song.</td>', 'Squeezed and spent.  Quite appropriate for the song.', '2008-03-06 20:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544067, 653299, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very poetic lyric.  Electricity detracts a bit from that waiting for the dawn feeling, but the big scary stone is nicely primitive-looking.</td>', 'Very poetic lyric.  Electricity detracts a bit from that waiting for the dawn feeling, but the big scary stone is nicely primitive-looking.', '2008-03-06 20:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544069, 653005, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks fresh-picked.</td>', 'Looks fresh-picked.', '2008-03-06 20:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544070, 653404, 65234, '<td valign="top">She''s glowing rather eerily.  Doesn''t quite seem to belong in her surroundings.</td>', 'She''s glowing rather eerily.  Doesn''t quite seem to belong in her surroundings.', '2008-03-06 20:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544072, 653084, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the DOF.  Muted colors and low hills in the background feel like this is a road that goes on and on and on.</td>', 'Like the DOF.  Muted colors and low hills in the background feel like this is a road that goes on and on and on.', '2008-03-06 20:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544080, 653714, 65234, '<td valign="top">Hand-rolled smoking thingy!  Sitting on a fan, which leads me to believe someone was trying to clear the smoke from the room.  Wonder what''s on the wall in the bathroom that he''s staring at?  Something cosmic, no doubt.</td>', 'Hand-rolled smoking thingy!  Sitting on a fan, which leads me to believe someone was trying to clear the smoke from the room.  Wonder what''s on the wall in the bathroom that he''s staring at?  Something cosmic, no doubt.', '2008-03-06 20:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544082, 653297, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement.  Considerably more artistic peel than I''m used to!</td>', 'Nice arrangement.  Considerably more artistic peel than I''m used to!', '2008-03-06 20:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544084, 653475, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait of a black dog!</td>', 'Very nice portrait of a black dog!', '2008-03-06 20:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544297, 653493, 89940, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. The shallow DOF doesn''t realy work for me. It kind of looks like the is lipstick on the lemon (orange??) but because it''s so blurry it''s not clear.</td>', 'Cute idea. The shallow DOF doesn''t realy work for me. It kind of looks like the is lipstick on the lemon (orange??) but because it''s so blurry it''s not clear.', '2008-03-06 21:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544307, 653535, 89940, '<td valign="top">This is a very busy photo. The kid is the obvious subject but then my eyes dart around the birds as well thinking they might be the subject. My eyes then dart to the seaweed on the beach and I follow the line of seaweed back to the boy starting the whole process again. I''m thinking a little tighter crop might fix some the of that, perhaps eliminating the seaweed and perhaps even some of the foreground birds.</td>', 'This is a very busy photo. The kid is the obvious subject but then my eyes dart around the birds as well thinking they might be the subject. My eyes then dart to the seaweed on the beach and I follow the line of seaweed back to the boy starting the whole process again. I''m thinking a little tighter crop might fix some the of that, perhaps eliminating the seaweed and perhaps even some of the foreground birds.', '2008-03-06 21:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544320, 652552, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice color and DOF. Technically it''s a nice photo but emotionally it doesn''t do anything for me. Makes me think more of an ad for Guitar Center.</td>', 'Nice color and DOF. Technically it''s a nice photo but emotionally it doesn''t do anything for me. Makes me think more of an ad for Guitar Center.', '2008-03-06 21:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544325, 652783, 89940, '<td valign="top">The DOF is nice although the background is very busy. I''m having a hard time with the scale on the photo. At first I thought this was a real size trike but then I look at the ground at it looks like bricks so then I''m thinking it''s a miniature.</td>', 'The DOF is nice although the background is very busy. I''m having a hard time with the scale on the photo. At first I thought this was a real size trike but then I look at the ground at it looks like bricks so then I''m thinking it''s a miniature.', '2008-03-06 21:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544327, 653713, 89940, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how the title relates to the photo. The color and lighting a re nice but emotionally it doesn''t do anything for me.</td>', 'I''m not sure how the title relates to the photo. The color and lighting a re nice but emotionally it doesn''t do anything for me.', '2008-03-06 22:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544331, 653790, 89940, '<td valign="top">One of the better tombstone shots in the challenge. Nice lighting/contrast, and B/W works well here. The crop is seems a little tight would like a little more space above the tombstone.</td>', 'One of the better tombstone shots in the challenge. Nice lighting/contrast, and B/W works well here. The crop is seems a little tight would like a little more space above the tombstone.', '2008-03-06 22:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544333, 653714, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. I like the capture of the smoke. The DOF works well. Would like to see a the guy be a little better lit and so much in shadow.</td>', 'Nice concept. I like the capture of the smoke. The DOF works well. Would like to see a the guy be a little better lit and so much in shadow.', '2008-03-06 22:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544334, 653567, 89940, '<td valign="top">Great color, like the lighting, also very sharp. Don''t like the reflections in the sunglasses, in fact I would probably do without the sunglasses.</td>', 'Great color, like the lighting, also very sharp. Don''t like the reflections in the sunglasses, in fact I would probably do without the sunglasses.', '2008-03-06 22:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544336, 652882, 89940, '<td valign="top">The color and lighting is great on the buildings. Really like the tone. The person is a little dark and doesn''t stand out enough against the building background. Also don''t care for the way the person is past the halfway point and appears to be walking out of the photo.</td>', 'The color and lighting is great on the buildings. Really like the tone. The person is a little dark and doesn''t stand out enough against the building background. Also don''t care for the way the person is past the halfway point and appears to be walking out of the photo.', '2008-03-06 22:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544523, 653582, 48963, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! Blue will be yours I predict.</td>', 'Fantastic! Blue will be yours I predict.', '2008-03-07 01:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544524, 653410, 48963, '<td valign="top">Best of all the tea shots so far. 9</td>', 'Best of all the tea shots so far. 9', '2008-03-07 01:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544562, 653818, 89940, '<td valign="top">Serious looking kid :)<br/> <br/>The boy''s jacket is a little dark hiding details. Don''t really like the vignetting and really don''t like the border.</td>', 'Serious looking kid :) The boy''s jacket is a little dark hiding details. Don''t really like the vignetting and really don''t like the border.', '2008-03-07 02:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544565, 653788, 89940, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. Don''t really care for the high key look and the washed out colors. Might be better as a pure B/W image.</td>', 'Interesting concept. Don''t really care for the high key look and the washed out colors. Might be better as a pure B/W image.', '2008-03-07 02:30:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4544567, 652599, 89940, '<td valign="top">Don''t really care of the high key look or the grain. Also don''t like the way the top of the head was cropped</td>', 'Don''t really care of the high key look or the grain. Also don''t like the way the top of the head was cropped', '2008-03-07 02:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544569, 653682, 89940, '<td valign="top">Really like the color of the tea. The highlight on the tea really makes it jump out, perhaps too much compared to the rest of the image. It causes the back of the cup and the handle to really stand out from the front of the cup and the tea pot.</td>', 'Really like the color of the tea. The highlight on the tea really makes it jump out, perhaps too much compared to the rest of the image. It causes the back of the cup and the handle to really stand out from the front of the cup and the tea pot.', '2008-03-07 02:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544570, 653759, 89940, '<td valign="top">Like the overall lighting. The selective color doesn''t really work for me in this photo. When I first looked at this photo I didn''t notice that the surroundings were B/W. I knew something didn''t feel right but it took a while to realize that the B/W background was what was bothering me.</td>', 'Like the overall lighting. The selective color doesn''t really work for me in this photo. When I first looked at this photo I didn''t notice that the surroundings were B/W. I knew something didn''t feel right but it took a while to realize that the B/W background was what was bothering me.', '2008-03-07 02:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544571, 653727, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice color. But overall I find the image uninteresting. It''s just a photo of a church but nothing to draw me in or move me.</td>', 'Nice color. But overall I find the image uninteresting. It''s just a photo of a church but nothing to draw me in or move me.', '2008-03-07 02:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544572, 653611, 89940, '<td valign="top">A very busy photo, my eyes jump all over. The river leads my eyes to the back of the photo but there is nothing of interest there. So then they jump to the hotel sign, nothing there either, keep jumping around and can''t identify a subject.</td>', 'A very busy photo, my eyes jump all over. The river leads my eyes to the back of the photo but there is nothing of interest there. So then they jump to the hotel sign, nothing there either, keep jumping around and can''t identify a subject.', '2008-03-07 02:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544578, 653458, 89940, '<td valign="top">A little dark for my taste. I''m also bothered by the fact that both of them (it''s one model right?) are staring off into space. It looks very unnatural.</td>', 'A little dark for my taste. I''m also bothered by the fact that both of them (it''s one model right?) are staring off into space. It looks very unnatural.', '2008-03-07 02:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544579, 653455, 89940, '<td valign="top">I like the foreground ice. The water is so choppy that I find it distracting. My eye keeps being drawn to it. I went back and forth trying to decide if it was water or land fpr quite a while</td>', 'I like the foreground ice. The water is so choppy that I find it distracting. My eye keeps being drawn to it. I went back and forth trying to decide if it was water or land fpr quite a while', '2008-03-07 02:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544580, 653283, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting overall. The reflections on the rings make them look out of focus.</td>', 'Nice lighting overall. The reflections on the rings make them look out of focus.', '2008-03-07 02:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544581, 653821, 89940, '<td valign="top">Really captures the feel of Led Zeppelin. It''s reminiscent of their album cover. The road really grabs my eye and leads it right out of the photo. I get to the edge and then my eye starts bouncing around trying to figure out what the subject is.</td>', 'Really captures the feel of Led Zeppelin. It''s reminiscent of their album cover. The road really grabs my eye and leads it right out of the photo. I get to the edge and then my eye starts bouncing around trying to figure out what the subject is.', '2008-03-07 02:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544582, 653816, 89940, '<td valign="top">I like the haze but the color of the beach and the purple in the water don''t work for me.</td>', 'I like the haze but the color of the beach and the purple in the water don''t work for me.', '2008-03-07 02:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544583, 653764, 89940, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a little harsh. I''m not sure if that''s what is causing it but there doesn''t seem to be much depth to the photo. The foreground colors kind of blend into the background colors.</td>', 'The lighting seems a little harsh. I''m not sure if that''s what is causing it but there doesn''t seem to be much depth to the photo. The foreground colors kind of blend into the background colors.', '2008-03-07 02:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544584, 653783, 89940, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. The glow around the person''s hear doesn''t work for me. A little too bright and intense.</td>', 'Interesting idea. The glow around the person''s hear doesn''t work for me. A little too bright and intense.', '2008-03-07 02:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544585, 653212, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but don''t really like the gold hue</td>', 'Nice composition but don''t really like the gold hue', '2008-03-07 02:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544586, 653297, 89940, '<td valign="top">The colors on the tangerines don''t look quite right, they look muted.</td>', 'The colors on the tangerines don''t look quite right, they look muted.', '2008-03-07 02:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544588, 653699, 89940, '<td valign="top">That''s an ugly looking lemon. :) <br/> <br/> <br/>I like the DOF but the background is a little distracting. The knife is OK but the other lemon halves (??) and the red thing don''t work for me.</td>', 'That''s an ugly looking lemon. :)   I like the DOF but the background is a little distracting. The knife is OK but the other lemon halves (??) and the red thing don''t work for me.', '2008-03-07 02:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
