(4544899, 653450, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this scene.  It has a hurry-up, let''s get out of this weather feel to it.  The background fog and water motion blur are very nice.  The dog has an issue or two...one could be seen as negative or positive, depending...that''s having him/her looking out of the frame.  Adds tension, like what''s out there that''s grabbing the dog''s attention?  On the potential negative side it (the dogs gaze) directs the view immediately out of the frame, rather than across.  Also seeing some sharpening artifacts, particularly the back leg and far right side area.<br/> <br/>All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this scene.  It has a hurry-up, let''s get out of this weather feel to it.  The background fog and water motion blur are very nice.  The dog has an issue or two...one could be seen as negative or positive, depending...that''s having him/her looking out of the frame.  Adds tension, like what''s out there that''s grabbing the dog''s attention?  On the potential negative side it (the dogs gaze) directs the view immediately out of the frame, rather than across.  Also seeing some sharpening artifacts, particularly the back leg and far right side area. All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-03-07 08:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
