(4544937, 653824, 48697, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting&amp; detail, I like the composition though I feel teh DOF is  bit shallow as teh left eye is bit oof. Still a cool shot!</td>', 'Nice lighting& detail, I like the composition though I feel teh DOF is  bit shallow as teh left eye is bit oof. Still a cool shot!', '2008-03-07 09:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
