(4547019, 653800, 77724, '<td valign="top">This is mildly disturbing such that I find it fascinating.  The tones, the contrast, the composition, all excellent.  A very powerful image.</td>', 'This is mildly disturbing such that I find it fascinating.  The tones, the contrast, the composition, all excellent.  A very powerful image.', '2008-03-07 23:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
