(4547337, 653727, 48697, '<td valign="top">I feel teh parking lot in the photo kind of takes away from the feel of the shot.</td>', 'I feel teh parking lot in the photo kind of takes away from the feel of the shot.', '2008-03-08 02:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
