(4547747, 653535, 32767, '<td valign="top">I like it lots. The lyrics of that song cover a lot of space and I have no idea how they piece together but who cares...primo drugs and alcohol, you know.<br/> <br/>You''ve captured very well, the feel of the music which I like, far better than most.</td>', 'I like it lots. The lyrics of that song cover a lot of space and I have no idea how they piece together but who cares...primo drugs and alcohol, you know. You''ve captured very well, the feel of the music which I like, far better than most.', '2008-03-08 08:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4547755, 653822, 32767, '<td valign="top">I actually think he/she knows exactly what''s going on... Exactly...</td>', 'I actually think he/she knows exactly what''s going on... Exactly...', '2008-03-08 08:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
