(4547760, 652596, 32767, '<td valign="top">Jeez, I try hard not to leave technical comments but while I like the fact that you cut the face I think you went a bit too far. I feel there''s a little more detail in her that I would like too see and to help me know more about her. Cheers!</td>', 'Jeez, I try hard not to leave technical comments but while I like the fact that you cut the face I think you went a bit too far. I feel there''s a little more detail in her that I would like too see and to help me know more about her. Cheers!', '2008-03-08 08:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4547772, 653804, 32767, '<td valign="top">A little Butt Boogie action...<br/> <br/>Hell Yeah...Sign me up!!!</td>', 'A little Butt Boogie action... Hell Yeah...Sign me up!!!', '2008-03-08 08:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4547778, 653713, 32767, '<td valign="top">Wow this is cool. TV is eating our brains.</td>', 'Wow this is cool. TV is eating our brains.', '2008-03-08 08:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4547797, 653450, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Ohh.. this suits the song well...  Well done.  Nice image, really like the feel.  Shame (maybe) he/she can''t be a <i>little</i> further in frame - but likely change the whole dynamics.</td>', '9 - Ohh.. this suits the song well...  Well done.  Nice image, really like the feel.  Shame (maybe) he/she can''t be a little further in frame - but likely change the whole dynamics.', '2008-03-08 08:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4547815, 653462, 40853, '<td valign="top">Nicest portrait I have seen in a long time. Simply Fucking Brilliant!!!<br/>10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10. I can''t get enough of looking at this photo. I want to by a print, but I would love to get it signed. Let me know if we can work this out.</td>', 'Nicest portrait I have seen in a long time. Simply Fucking Brilliant!!!10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10. I can''t get enough of looking at this photo. I want to by a print, but I would love to get it signed. Let me know if we can work this out.', '2008-03-08 08:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4548139, 653728, 1031, '<td valign="top">Given that this was Advanced editing, I''d have cloned-out the bright contrail at the center-left -- it seems to distract from the overall "flow" of the eye through the picture. Otherwise, it''s an effective use of negative space and has great colors.</td>', 'Given that this was Advanced editing, I''d have cloned-out the bright contrail at the center-left -- it seems to distract from the overall "flow" of the eye through the picture. Otherwise, it''s an effective use of negative space and has great colors.', '2008-03-08 11:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4548156, 653699, 1031, '<td valign="top">Interesting take -- makes me wonder what''s cooking. :-)<br/> <br/>My friend Tom, who has been both an industrial analytical chemist and professional cook, recommends only using organic fruit in any recipe calling for citrus peel, as most of the nasty chemicals used in growing it are oil-soluble, and may remain present within the rind even after carefully washing the surface.</td>', 'Interesting take -- makes me wonder what''s cooking. :-) My friend Tom, who has been both an industrial analytical chemist and professional cook, recommends only using organic fruit in any recipe calling for citrus peel, as most of the nasty chemicals used in growing it are oil-soluble, and may remain present within the rind even after carefully washing the surface.', '2008-03-08 11:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4548451, 653677, 32767, '<td valign="top">I wonder how this is doing in the voting? I like the sense of motion you''ve captured. Nice timing on the twirl.</td>', 'I wonder how this is doing in the voting? I like the sense of motion you''ve captured. Nice timing on the twirl.', '2008-03-08 14:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4548488, 653800, 91178, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Best shot I''ve seen in this whole set</td>', 'Awesome. Best shot I''ve seen in this whole set', '2008-03-08 14:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4548591, 653829, 39850, '<td valign="top">Magical feel to this image.  Very nice.  Ahh, I think perhaps multiple <i>exposures</i> have come into play in the water - works very well though.  8.</td>', 'Magical feel to this image.  Very nice.  Ahh, I think perhaps multiple exposures have come into play in the water - works very well though.  8.', '2008-03-08 15:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4548609, 651155, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Quite a fitting image for this song.</td>', '7 - Quite a fitting image for this song.', '2008-03-08 15:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
