(4549675, 653597, 70875, '<td valign="top">This has something very compelling to it. I''m amazed how many people you got in the frame, looks like emergency stairs but way to crowded for one. The top right character is rather intriguing, he''s pointing to somewhere I really can''t make out his face. In fact the only clear face is the one on the center left, all others are hidden.</td>', 'This has something very compelling to it. I''m amazed how many people you got in the frame, looks like emergency stairs but way to crowded for one. The top right character is rather intriguing, he''s pointing to somewhere I really can''t make out his face. In fact the only clear face is the one on the center left, all others are hidden.', '2008-03-09 08:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
