(4549908, 653535, 41357, '<td valign="top">very nice -8</td>', 'very nice -8', '2008-03-09 12:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549954, 652596, 58452, '<td valign="top">I like this composition.  Since advanced editing is available I wish you''d helped the model with a little eyewash. :) It looks as if some kind of layering process was applied to her cheek and it FAILED. And I''d liked to see just a bit more of her nose in the crop. Even with its imperfections I like it.</td>', 'I like this composition.  Since advanced editing is available I wish you''d helped the model with a little eyewash. :) It looks as if some kind of layering process was applied to her cheek and it FAILED. And I''d liked to see just a bit more of her nose in the crop. Even with its imperfections I like it.', '2008-03-09 12:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4549965, 653535, 58452, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. I love that his foot is up as it shows the motion of the run. Seems almost unreal sharp on first viewing. But I don''t think I see any halos so I guess it''s just the extremely bright lighting combined with a polarizer. (I think?)  And of course the burst of winged activity from the center of the image makes the shot.</td>', 'Very nice image. I love that his foot is up as it shows the motion of the run. Seems almost unreal sharp on first viewing. But I don''t think I see any halos so I guess it''s just the extremely bright lighting combined with a polarizer. (I think?)  And of course the burst of winged activity from the center of the image makes the shot.', '2008-03-09 12:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550035, 653499, 70270, '<td valign="top">The clouds make this shot, and bring in the sense of gloom that help it fit the challenge.</td>', 'The clouds make this shot, and bring in the sense of gloom that help it fit the challenge.', '2008-03-09 13:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550040, 653769, 70270, '<td valign="top">I like the processing and oddness of this shot.  It has the feel of an old ''70s album cover where different images were pasted on to the background as some kine of statement on the inanity of modern urban life.  That said, though, I don''t like the building in the background to this shot.  Love the foreground, hate the background.  That''s my comment!</td>', 'I like the processing and oddness of this shot.  It has the feel of an old ''70s album cover where different images were pasted on to the background as some kine of statement on the inanity of modern urban life.  That said, though, I don''t like the building in the background to this shot.  Love the foreground, hate the background.  That''s my comment!', '2008-03-09 13:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550045, 652390, 70270, '<td valign="top">The flower in her hair is a nice touch, and her expression helps, but even with the stand up guitar this photo doesn''t make me think of LedZep, or the girl in Going to California.</td>', 'The flower in her hair is a nice touch, and her expression helps, but even with the stand up guitar this photo doesn''t make me think of LedZep, or the girl in Going to California.', '2008-03-09 13:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550053, 653494, 70270, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  I have a lifelong collection of trail markers like this.  But unfortunately this shot has no real connection, for me, with the song, nor does it evoke that dark zeppelin like feeling.</td>', 'I love this photo.  I have a lifelong collection of trail markers like this.  But unfortunately this shot has no real connection, for me, with the song, nor does it evoke that dark zeppelin like feeling.', '2008-03-09 13:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550060, 653299, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice dark and ominous image that fits the songs of Led Zeppelin very well, and the faint sunset and dark buildings with the strange obelisk lit up in the foreground has us waiting for the Battle of Evermore.  Nice job!</td>', 'Nice dark and ominous image that fits the songs of Led Zeppelin very well, and the faint sunset and dark buildings with the strange obelisk lit up in the foreground has us waiting for the Battle of Evermore.  Nice job!', '2008-03-09 13:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550066, 653493, 70270, '<td valign="top">Funny shot, well composed, like the DOF treatment ... but has no real connection to the song.  "... I went to sleep last night, I work as hard as I can-a I bring home my money, you take my money, give it to another man;<br/>I should have quite you, baby-a, oh, such a long time ago-ho; I wouldn''t be hear withall my troubles; nn-down on this killin'' floor."</td>', 'Funny shot, well composed, like the DOF treatment ... but has no real connection to the song.  "... I went to sleep last night, I work as hard as I can-a I bring home my money, you take my money, give it to another man;I should have quite you, baby-a, oh, such a long time ago-ho; I wouldn''t be hear withall my troubles; nn-down on this killin'' floor."', '2008-03-09 13:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550069, 652594, 70270, '<td valign="top">I like the dramatic lighting in this shot and the cemetery in the background that shows the ravages of the Battle of Evermore.  The saturation and focus on this shot, while not DPC friendly, evokes the feel of a ''70s polaroid shot for me.</td>', 'I like the dramatic lighting in this shot and the cemetery in the background that shows the ravages of the Battle of Evermore.  The saturation and focus on this shot, while not DPC friendly, evokes the feel of a ''70s polaroid shot for me.', '2008-03-09 13:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550072, 653005, 70270, '<td valign="top">OK, its a tangerine.  And I do like the focus on the leaves.  But other than the title, it has nothing to do with song and does nothing to make me think of Led Zep.</td>', 'OK, its a tangerine.  And I do like the focus on the leaves.  But other than the title, it has nothing to do with song and does nothing to make me think of Led Zep.', '2008-03-09 13:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550073, 653177, 70270, '<td valign="top">This kind of fits the song, which to me is about people being too rushed in modern life and not taking the time to appreciate the beauty around them.  I think your feet evoke that feeling.  I just wish this was either more ominous or the scene more beautiful; its a little flat to carry the day for me.</td>', 'This kind of fits the song, which to me is about people being too rushed in modern life and not taking the time to appreciate the beauty around them.  I think your feet evoke that feeling.  I just wish this was either more ominous or the scene more beautiful; its a little flat to carry the day for me.', '2008-03-09 13:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550075, 653684, 70270, '<td valign="top">OK bird shot, but not really connected to the song and doesn''t have that Led Zeppelin feel.</td>', 'OK bird shot, but not really connected to the song and doesn''t have that Led Zeppelin feel.', '2008-03-09 13:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550080, 653800, 70270, '<td valign="top">LOL.  Nice fit with the song, and looks like you put a fair amount of work into it.  To me, the staring straight into the camera doesn''t work quite as well, since it keeps the image a bit static and loses the sense of movement and voyeurism that the song is about.</td>', 'LOL.  Nice fit with the song, and looks like you put a fair amount of work into it.  To me, the staring straight into the camera doesn''t work quite as well, since it keeps the image a bit static and loses the sense of movement and voyeurism that the song is about.', '2008-03-09 13:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550083, 653450, 70270, '<td valign="top">Its a black dog.  Down by the seaside.  But there''s no mama to watch that''s making me sweat or groove!  Which is just to say there ain''t no connection to the song.  Nice B+W image, tho, and I''ll give ya props for the dark, edgy feel which is kinda Led Zeppish</td>', 'Its a black dog.  Down by the seaside.  But there''s no mama to watch that''s making me sweat or groove!  Which is just to say there ain''t no connection to the song.  Nice B+W image, tho, and I''ll give ya props for the dark, edgy feel which is kinda Led Zeppish', '2008-03-09 13:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550087, 653676, 70270, '<td valign="top">Meh.  Doesn''t evoke the spirit of Led Zep or the song for me, and photo itself doesn''t hold my interest.  Sorry.</td>', 'Meh.  Doesn''t evoke the spirit of Led Zep or the song for me, and photo itself doesn''t hold my interest.  Sorry.', '2008-03-09 13:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550089, 653253, 70270, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The processing is edgy and vaguely 70s like, and it has a nice fit with the album.</td>', 'I like this.  The processing is edgy and vaguely 70s like, and it has a nice fit with the album.', '2008-03-09 13:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550090, 653265, 70270, '<td valign="top">Cute portrait, but not really something you''d ever find in a led zeppelin album.</td>', 'Cute portrait, but not really something you''d ever find in a led zeppelin album.', '2008-03-09 13:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550093, 652990, 70270, '<td valign="top">Interesting ghost image.  Wish the ghosts looked or were dressed like bikers ... now THAT might have really evoked the spirit of Led Zep for me.  Still a nice try.</td>', 'Interesting ghost image.  Wish the ghosts looked or were dressed like bikers ... now THAT might have really evoked the spirit of Led Zep for me.  Still a nice try.', '2008-03-09 13:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550095, 653802, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice edgy shot and a great attempt at evoking the song and the spirit of the band.  Lighting is too flat and focus is too soft to really carry it through for me tho.</td>', 'Nice edgy shot and a great attempt at evoking the song and the spirit of the band.  Lighting is too flat and focus is too soft to really carry it through for me tho.', '2008-03-09 13:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4550098, 653829, 70270, '<td valign="top">Beautiful ocean shot.  Just an OK fit with the song and the band tho.</td>', 'Beautiful ocean shot.  Just an OK fit with the song and the band tho.', '2008-03-09 13:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
