(4550310, 653462, 7778, '<td valign="top">Energy/Range/Story: 10/8/9 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 7/7/6 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical: 6/5 <br/>Presentation: 7 <br/>Total: 7.2 <br/>Vote: 8 <br/> <br/>Remarks:  although manner and treatment are entirely consistent with a photojournalistic approach (emphasizing an event), the subject''s focus and expression reveal an intensity that go beyond the event and suggest a portrait. <br/> <br/>What we have here (IMO) is a shot that stands between these genres, poignantly reminiscent of the turmoil it evokes. This is a remarkably provoking photograph, a great find and realized opportunity, I awarded it an 8, instead off rounding the stats (above), as I usually do.</td>', 'Energy/Range/Story: 10/8/9 Composition/perspective/manner: 7/7/6 Aesthetics/Technical: 6/5 Presentation: 7 Total: 7.2 Vote: 8  Remarks:  although manner and treatment are entirely consistent with a photojournalistic approach (emphasizing an event), the subject''s focus and expression reveal an intensity that go beyond the event and suggest a portrait.  What we have here (IMO) is a shot that stands between these genres, poignantly reminiscent of the turmoil it evokes. This is a remarkably provoking photograph, a great find and realized opportunity, I awarded it an 8, instead off rounding the stats (above), as I usually do.', '2008-03-09 16:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
