(4551011, 653730, 74534, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite "In my time of dying" photo in this challenge, and there have been a few. Walking into the strong light, out of the clutter of this hallway... I like th interpretation a lot. Good contrast, silhouette is well defined and very good visual "punch".</td>', 'This is my favorite "In my time of dying" photo in this challenge, and there have been a few. Walking into the strong light, out of the clutter of this hallway... I like th interpretation a lot. Good contrast, silhouette is well defined and very good visual "punch".', '2008-03-09 22:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
