(4551018, 653714, 74534, '<td valign="top">Max points for idea and set-up, very expressive and spot-on, captures a feeling and a state of mind so well. This is what a photo should be all about, so a 9 from me, Unfortunately, let down a bit by execution and technicals IMHO. The blue color cast affecting only part of the image is distracting. Also, a large part of the photo is a rather gray and uninteresting wall. As a result, the image feels "flat".</td>', 'Max points for idea and set-up, very expressive and spot-on, captures a feeling and a state of mind so well. This is what a photo should be all about, so a 9 from me, Unfortunately, let down a bit by execution and technicals IMHO. The blue color cast affecting only part of the image is distracting. Also, a large part of the photo is a rather gray and uninteresting wall. As a result, the image feels "flat".', '2008-03-09 22:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
