(4551028, 652741, 74534, '<td valign="top">Very good take on the chosen theme. The blur on the girl makes it look like she and the guy are really in different "planes" with very little chance of meeting somewhere in the middle.</td>', 'Very good take on the chosen theme. The blur on the girl makes it look like she and the guy are really in different "planes" with very little chance of meeting somewhere in the middle.', '2008-03-09 23:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
