(4551035, 653535, 74534, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of energy and expression - most important aspects of an image. 8 from me, it just feels like the lighting is too harsh, the image too contrasty and maybe a bit over-sharpened as well.</td>', 'Excellent capture of energy and expression - most important aspects of an image. 8 from me, it just feels like the lighting is too harsh, the image too contrasty and maybe a bit over-sharpened as well.', '2008-03-09 23:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
