(4551394, 653729, 22301, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon Enzo, liked it from when I first saw it. After looking at the image a few times I started thinking the "8''s" are really just words or numbers on the bus and the speed of the bus is just right that lights kept popping up in the same space. With the different numbers/letters lighting all the light slots to make it look like an 8. Maybe?<br/>Either way its really cool. :)</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon Enzo, liked it from when I first saw it. After looking at the image a few times I started thinking the "8''s" are really just words or numbers on the bus and the speed of the bus is just right that lights kept popping up in the same space. With the different numbers/letters lighting all the light slots to make it look like an 8. Maybe?Either way its really cool. :)', '2008-03-10 04:26:05.000000', NULL, 0),
