(4551517, 651112, 51793, '<td valign="top">Whoo hooo look at you pulling 78 out of 139. Congrats man... OH and a new PB. Double congrats... Try using a lower ISO and a longer shutter time to remove image grain. usually ISO 100 or 200 is a good start.</td>', 'Whoo hooo look at you pulling 78 out of 139. Congrats man... OH and a new PB. Double congrats... Try using a lower ISO and a longer shutter time to remove image grain. usually ISO 100 or 200 is a good start.', '2008-03-10 07:11:29.000000', NULL, 0),
