(4551565, 653829, 39850, '<td valign="top">One of the Led Zeppelin songs I am not <i>that</i> familiar with.  After I voted I looked up the lyrics and saw that this song is about the crowd, still - a beautiful image that is a good visual analogy anyway.  Not sure why I thought I thought this was multiple exposures, instead of the obvious <i>long</i> exposure.  Very nice capture of the ocean, that, again, has a ''mystical'' feel, as so many of their songs have.</td>', 'One of the Led Zeppelin songs I am not that familiar with.  After I voted I looked up the lyrics and saw that this song is about the crowd, still - a beautiful image that is a good visual analogy anyway.  Not sure why I thought I thought this was multiple exposures, instead of the obvious long exposure.  Very nice capture of the ocean, that, again, has a ''mystical'' feel, as so many of their songs have.', '2008-03-10 08:12:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4551568, 653450, 39850, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite image in this Challenge.  Really liked the processing on this, but especially liked the ''feel'' with the dog looking out into the harsh ocean and those wild and windswept trees on the rocks/cliff face.  For me this Challenge was primarily about matching the feel of an image with that of the song, and in this, I think you did it very well.</td>', 'This was my favorite image in this Challenge.  Really liked the processing on this, but especially liked the ''feel'' with the dog looking out into the harsh ocean and those wild and windswept trees on the rocks/cliff face.  For me this Challenge was primarily about matching the feel of an image with that of the song, and in this, I think you did it very well.', '2008-03-10 08:15:37.000000', NULL, 0),
