(4553314, 652882, 56744, '<td valign="top">Superb image Steve. So much detail to look at. The composition and dynamic of the leading lines works beautifully and my eyes never get tired to look at this image. The reflections on the windows also adds more deep to the photo. You''re a killer when it comes to shot NYC buildings. Hey! Congrats for the ribbon</td>', 'Superb image Steve. So much detail to look at. The composition and dynamic of the leading lines works beautifully and my eyes never get tired to look at this image. The reflections on the windows also adds more deep to the photo. You''re a killer when it comes to shot NYC buildings. Hey! Congrats for the ribbon', '2008-03-10 20:19:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4553322, 653729, 56744, '<td valign="top">Enzo, you''ve a recognizable style and it''s an amazing one. That''s good, I mean... That''s great! Congrats on the Ribbon.</td>', 'Enzo, you''ve a recognizable style and it''s an amazing one. That''s good, I mean... That''s great! Congrats on the Ribbon.', '2008-03-10 20:25:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4553330, 653716, 70270, '<td valign="top">I did not rate this one highly, and that was because, in this challenge, my vote was heavily influenced by whether it met the meaning of the song, or at least evoked the spirit or feel of Led Zeppelin either by borrowing elements from their album art or using edgy or dark post-processing.  I think I was probably in the minority in that approach, among both the shooters and the voters.<br/> <br/>I can''t really speak to your 8s or 10s.  Maybe they were being deliberately contrary.  Or maybe they didn''t care so much about the music and just really liked your picture.  ;&gt;P</td>', 'I did not rate this one highly, and that was because, in this challenge, my vote was heavily influenced by whether it met the meaning of the song, or at least evoked the spirit or feel of Led Zeppelin either by borrowing elements from their album art or using edgy or dark post-processing.  I think I was probably in the minority in that approach, among both the shooters and the voters. I can''t really speak to your 8s or 10s.  Maybe they were being deliberately contrary.  Or maybe they didn''t care so much about the music and just really liked your picture.  ;>P', '2008-03-10 20:28:26.000000', NULL, 0),
