(4554887, 653541, 51538, '<td valign="top">It only occurred to me after I had voted that in fact young ''un there is looking to the east (I always think of myself looking toward the north ;-).  But such is life.  Still a shot worthy of the challenge and one of your best IMO.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-03-11 12:17:07.</i></td>', 'It only occurred to me after I had voted that in fact young ''un there is looking to the east (I always think of myself looking toward the north ;-).  But such is life.  Still a shot worthy of the challenge and one of your best IMO.', '2008-03-11 12:16:30.000000', '2008-03-11 12:17:07.000000', 0),
(4554890, 653716, 67697, '<td valign="top">I did not vote in this challenge and I am not familiar with a lot of Led Zepplin stuff.  But I did want to say that I bet it would have scored higher if you had a shoehorn tucked in there somewhere :D  hehe</td>', 'I did not vote in this challenge and I am not familiar with a lot of Led Zepplin stuff.  But I did want to say that I bet it would have scored higher if you had a shoehorn tucked in there somewhere :D  hehe', '2008-03-11 12:17:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4554912, 653567, 67697, '<td valign="top">I don''t know the song at all so I cannot really understand how the two go together.  Just looking at it from a photography perspective, what really cracks me up is how K looks like he is really digging his music.  Got that good musician sneer on.  hehe  I can''t believe he sat on the snow like that for you.  So funny!</td>', 'I don''t know the song at all so I cannot really understand how the two go together.  Just looking at it from a photography perspective, what really cracks me up is how K looks like he is really digging his music.  Got that good musician sneer on.  hehe  I can''t believe he sat on the snow like that for you.  So funny!', '2008-03-11 12:24:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4555061, 653541, 29011, '<td valign="top">phew, so glad many of the voters liked this one as I do. The shot would make a great insert. I eco what the others have already said, great shot :)</td>', 'phew, so glad many of the voters liked this one as I do. The shot would make a great insert. I eco what the others have already said, great shot :)', '2008-03-11 13:37:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4555075, 653294, 29011, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. I really dig the tones. Really like the composition. I agree with david_c, pitty about the shadow but can be cropped out for a wide landscape crop, would work really great for this one too. I like the surfer in the shot too btw.</td>', 'Cool shot. I really dig the tones. Really like the composition. I agree with david_c, pitty about the shadow but can be cropped out for a wide landscape crop, would work really great for this one too. I like the surfer in the shot too btw.', '2008-03-11 13:43:39.000000', NULL, 0),
