(4557252, 653683, 30982, '<td valign="top">I liked the skin tone and figured it was entirely intentional - the shot as a whole works this way for me just fine.  Excellent work on this - from the concept through the shoot to the post processing.</td>', 'I liked the skin tone and figured it was entirely intentional - the shot as a whole works this way for me just fine.  Excellent work on this - from the concept through the shoot to the post processing.', '2008-03-12 07:17:26.000000', NULL, 0),
