(4569402, 653699, 67697, '<td valign="top">I have no clue about the song lol.  This looks more like a lemon masacre hehe.  The big knife in the background, the lemon shards, the textured grooves, the gutted lemon... the cool bokeh!  Lots of interesting stuff to see in this photo.</td>', 'I have no clue about the song lol.  This looks more like a lemon masacre hehe.  The big knife in the background, the lemon shards, the textured grooves, the gutted lemon... the cool bokeh!  Lots of interesting stuff to see in this photo.', '2008-03-17 13:21:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4569409, 653717, 67697, '<td valign="top">If I knew the song, I''d probably understand some of this a little more lol.  I love that tea set but I think you needed a lighter background or a backlight so that the tea pot did not get lost.  I do love looking around at all the elements in disarray.  You''ll have to fill me in on the ripped up flower, tho lol.</td>', 'If I knew the song, I''d probably understand some of this a little more lol.  I love that tea set but I think you needed a lighter background or a backlight so that the tea pot did not get lost.  I do love looking around at all the elements in disarray.  You''ll have to fill me in on the ripped up flower, tho lol.', '2008-03-17 13:26:06.000000', NULL, 0),
