(4734339, 652882, 74979, '<td valign="top">I love your frustration, your explanation about vanished POVs and the image!!  Excellent view of the streets of NYC, complete with garbage cans, I have always loved the repetitive lines in the architecture of the place..<br/> <br/><i>Damn</i> If only I had (1) known you and (2) been into photography when I lived in NYC...I''d have been a major PITA begging you to go out on photo jaunts, &amp; asking you a million questions, but we''d have laffed a lot too!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I love your frustration, your explanation about vanished POVs and the image!!  Excellent view of the streets of NYC, complete with garbage cans, I have always loved the repetitive lines in the architecture of the place.. Damn If only I had (1) known you and (2) been into photography when I lived in NYC...I''d have been a major PITA begging you to go out on photo jaunts, & asking you a million questions, but we''d have laffed a lot too!! ', '2008-05-30 10:02:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4735779, 653804, 20506, '<td valign="top">Very, very clever. Great concept very errr cheeky!!! Please tell me you didn''t rip cut or destroy a perfectly good pair of jeans for a shot? LOL I know if I''d thought of this I would have too. :))</td>', 'Very, very clever. Great concept very errr cheeky!!! Please tell me you didn''t rip cut or destroy a perfectly good pair of jeans for a shot? LOL I know if I''d thought of this I would have too. :))', '2008-05-31 03:28:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4941112, 652390, 69008, '<td valign="top">I missed this in voting. You did a nice job of portraying a period of time that I grew up in.  The very wide angle lens setting makes for an interesting composition/perspective, bringing your face to the front of the interest in the image. <br/>The classical guitar seems a little out of place for a Zep thing. It''s a good prop for the challenge anyway, as most people would not know the difference.</td>', 'I missed this in voting. You did a nice job of portraying a period of time that I grew up in.  The very wide angle lens setting makes for an interesting composition/perspective, bringing your face to the front of the interest in the image. The classical guitar seems a little out of place for a Zep thing. It''s a good prop for the challenge anyway, as most people would not know the difference.', '2008-09-08 01:21:01.000000', NULL, 0),
